---
layout: base.njk
---
{% set editorialTopics = [topics[1], topics[0], topics[2], topics[3], topics[4], topics[5]] %}
<div class="c-composition">
  <section class="c-hero" aria-labelledby="c-title" data-reveal>
    <div class="c-edition-line"><span>SOMANI / LIVING ARCHIVE</span><span>ULSAN · 2026</span></div>
    <h1 id="c-title"><span>somani's</span><em>living</em><span>archive.</span></h1>
    <div class="c-intro"><p><strong>안녕하세요, somani입니다.</strong> 시스템 해킹과 리버싱을 중심으로 CTF와 개발 과정에서 배우고 경험한 것들을 기록합니다.</p><p>System Hacking · Reversing · CTF · Development</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="c-workspace" aria-labelledby="c-workspace-title" data-reveal>
    <header class="c-workspace-header"><div><p class="prototype-kicker">WORKSPACE / 03 ACTIVE VIEWS</p><h2 id="c-workspace-title">Working <em>set.</em></h2></div><span class="c-workspace-mark" aria-hidden="true">s.</span></header>
    <div class="c-window-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="워크스페이스 보기" data-tablist>
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="c-profile-window" id="c-profile-tab">01 Profile</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="c-note-window" id="c-note-tab" tabindex="-1">02 Latest</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="c-project-window" id="c-project-tab" tabindex="-1">03 Project</button>
    </div>
    <div class="c-window-stage">
      <article class="desktop-window c-window c-profile-window is-active" id="c-profile-window" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="c-profile-tab" data-tab-panel>
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>somani.profile</span><a href="/about/">Full profile ↗</a></header>
        <div class="c-profile-body"><img src="{{ profile.image }}" alt="{{ profile.imageAlt }}" width="736" height="781"><div><p class="window-overline">OWNER / ICT CONVERGENCE</p><h3>Hello, I'm somani.</h3><p>{{ profile.affiliation }}</p><ul>{% for interest in profile.primaryInterests %}<li>{{ interest }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></div>
      </article>
      {% for post in collections.posts | take(1) %}
      <article class="desktop-window c-window c-note-window" id="c-note-window" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="c-note-tab" data-tab-panel aria-hidden="true" inert>
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>latest.note</span><time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateISO }}</time></header>
        <div class="c-note-body"><p class="window-overline">{{ post.data.categories[0] }} / {{ post.data.tags | join(' · ') }}</p><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><a class="prototype-arrow-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read the editorial note <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
      {% for project in projects | take(1) %}
      <article class="desktop-window c-window c-project-window" id="c-project-window" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="c-project-tab" data-tab-panel aria-hidden="true" inert>
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>selected.work</span><a href="{{ project.repository }}">GitHub ↗</a></header>
        <div class="c-project-body"><p class="window-overline">PROJECT / 01</p><h3>{{ project.name }}</h3><p>{{ project.description }}</p><div class="mini-stack">{% for technology in project.stack %}<span>{{ technology }}</span>{% endfor %}</div><a class="prototype-arrow-link" href="{{ project.post }}">Read the build record <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="c-window-help"><span><i></i> active view</span><span>Click a tab or use arrow keys.</span></p>
  </section>

  <section class="c-index-section" aria-labelledby="c-index-title" data-reveal data-category-index>
    <header class="c-index-heading"><div><p class="prototype-kicker">ARCHIVE INDEX / 06 FIELDS</p><h2 id="c-index-title">Choose a<br><em>field note.</em></h2></div><p>카테고리에 포커스하거나 마우스를 올리면 설명과 최신 기록을 미리 볼 수 있습니다.</p></header>
    <div class="c-index-layout">
      <ol class="c-category-list">
        {% for category in editorialTopics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
        <li{% if loop.first %} class="is-active"{% endif %}><a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/" data-category-trigger data-preview-id="c-category-{{ loop.index }}"{% if loop.first %} data-active="true"{% endif %}><span class="c-category-number">0{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="c-category-name"><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><em>{{ category.label }}</em></span><span class="c-category-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="c-mobile-category-summary">{{ category.description }} · {{ categoryPosts | length }}개 기록{% for post in categoryPosts | take(1) %}<br>Latest — {{ post.data.title }}{% endfor %}</span></a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      <div class="c-category-preview" aria-live="polite">
        {% for category in editorialTopics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
        <section id="c-category-{{ loop.index }}" data-category-panel{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
          <div class="c-preview-label"><span>FIELD 0{{ loop.index }}</span><span>{{ categoryPosts | length }} NOTE{% if (categoryPosts | length) != 1 %}S{% endif %}</span></div>
          <h3>{{ category.label }}</h3><p>{{ category.description }}</p>
          {% for post in categoryPosts | take(1) %}<div class="c-preview-latest"><span>LATEST / {{ post.date | dateISO }}</span><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }} ↗</a></div>{% else %}<div class="c-preview-empty"><span>LATEST</span><p>아직 공개된 기록이 없습니다.</p></div>{% endfor %}
          <a class="c-preview-open" href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/">카테고리 열기 <span>↗</span></a>
        </section>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
